{"id":"666762","name":"紫菜黄豆芽汤","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/666762/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄豆芽","amount":"200g"},{"name":"紫菜","amount":"10g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"紫菜备用。","img":"images/666762/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"紫菜泡发洗净，撕成小块。","img":"images/666762/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"黄豆芽去豆皮，去根，洗净。","img":"images/666762/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒜末备用。","img":"images/666762/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内放适量纯净水，再放入黄豆芽。","img":"images/666762/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大火煮沸，转小火煮15分钟。","img":"images/666762/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"继续放入紫菜、蒜末和盐。","img":"images/666762/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"滴几滴香油。","img":"images/666762/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/666762/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盛入碗中。","img":"images/666762/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"清淡可口。","img":"images/666762/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}